.Ed
.Pp
The test suite is not in regular goldens; the TESTS and KSH columns say
so, and only
.Cm golden-ztest
images need it.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr klab-exporter 8 ,
.Xr klab-prom-targets 8 ,
.Xr klab-vm-debug-bundle 8 ,
.Xr kube-cluster 8 ,
.Xr kzfs-lab 8 ,
.Xr kzfs-test 8
.Sh HISTORY
It grew from
.Xr kzfs-test 8
and
.Xr kzfs-lab 8 .
On 2026-09-30, writing this page: every regular golden was judged
.Dq PARTIAL (no tests)
because the test suite, which it leaves out on purpose, was missing \(em
so every build rebuilt all of them, and the sites cloned from them went
with them.
.Sh AUTHORS
.An kldload Aq Mt anthony@kldload.com
.Sh CAVEATS
A golden is rebuilt with
.Ql zfs destroy -R ,
which takes every clone of it, whoever made them.
